    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Majid Fatemian",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115371729218118019205/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU4vAIHHSVOWO6LVV-snq5Lnxcdul4UkEAiAiCOUiHiTWws6qaS6w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "In the summer of 2025, we did a complete backyard renovation with PowerStone, and the experience was nothing short of outstanding. What started as a blank, empty space is now a stunning resort-style oasis that we never want to leave.\n\nPowerStone delivered a true turn-key project, handling every detail with precision and care — from the pavers around the pool, fences, custom shed, and lighting to stepping stones, fresh sod, beautifully crafted retaining walls, and redesigned window wells. Every element was perfectly executed.\n\nThe owners, Nick and Andrew, were phenomenal throughout the process. Their professionalism, accuracy, and attention to detail are second to none. They constantly went above and beyond — catching and fixing the smallest imperfections before we even noticed them.\n\nTheir estimate was transparent and detailed, the pricing was fair, and the quality of workmanship was exceptional.\n\nPowerStone truly over-delivered in every aspect. Our backyard feels like a luxury retreat, and we couldn’t be happier with the result.\n\nIf I could give them more than 5 stars, I absolutely would. PowerStone sets the gold standard for landscaping excellence.\n\nI have added two before photos and a few from after.",
        "time": 1759974315,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michael Michailidis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110932223920505157623/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL277KVKruGwqAGEPo3fOgjr7sVOhExkCXor4cW2p4Y067EyzKU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Powerstone did a fantastic job on our backyard remodel. Working with the team was a great experience, they finished the project on budget and on time. Very pleased and excited that we can finally enjoy our yard to its fullest! Thank you!",
        "time": 1748389701,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Uros Milekic",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107009757549212767944/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYrB3_ftKOMeaqQAfC1nSTp5rVmDAfXnruCAzflledBMnma4I=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "A couple of years ago, the Powerstone team completely rebuilt our backyard, and to this day, our family couldn’t be happier with the final result. The space has truly transformed the way we enjoy our home… it’s functional, beautiful, and still feels brand new every time we step outside.\n\nFrom start to finish, Powerstone was professional, detail-oriented, and a pleasure to work with. Nick and Andrew were personally involved and made sure every aspect of the project met our expectations. Their leadership and commitment really stood out. The entire crew was friendly, respectful, and easy to deal with… something that made the whole experience even better.\n\nWe also appreciated their after-sale service; they followed up, made sure we were happy, and addressed any questions promptly. It’s rare to see that level of care.\n\nGreat team. Great service. And most importantly, happy customers… even two years later! Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1748372966,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kulbir Singh Madhok",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113363621259870574121/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWqxvspqzhK8aD2_hua3w6u0Acm3YX-S0qmgNZrIEqYxiNNi6N7Tw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve worked with Andrew from Group Powerstone a couple of years back. He helped me transfer my backyard which included doing some landscaping, unistone patio, grass, garage base installation. Overall, the team did a wonderful job. They were very easy to coordinate with and also worked with other contractors like fencing and irrigation system in order to compete the project in a timely manner. I highly recommend Groupe Powerstone for all your landscaping needs.",
        "time": 1751661152,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Matthew Letourneau",
